`𝒟_{W,t_-}(A)=Σ_qE_{W,t_-}({q})AE_{W,t_-}({q})`,

`Σ_ννp_{W;t_-,t_+}(ν)=
 ⟨Q̂(t_-)⟩-⟨𝒟_{W,t_-}(Q̂(t_+))⟩`.                 **(IDX.4)**

**⟨2⟩1.** The first measured value contributes `Σ_qq⟨E_{t_-}({q})⟩` and the
