the same scalar `c` on every site) gives `e^{-2πiρ}=c`.

*Justification.* D2(a) (the circle lies in `H_β`), (S) at `β`, (INT).

**⟨2⟩5.** Dividing: `e^{4πiρ}=1`, so `2ρ∈ℤ`; and `c=e^{2πiρ}∈{±1}`.
**QED.**

