+STATUS: PROVED-candidate
+Established: the unbroken-vacuum density functional is Ad-invariant, kills the semisimple commutator algebra, and is supported on the connected group center; nonzero jumps descend to the effective center.
+Established: same-window joint TPM for r central circles has outcome in the effective weight lattice (Z^r in primitive coordinates); under the explicitly stronger joint-D27 hypothesis, delta x_j=-(2s_j)^-1 sum_nu nu_j p(nu).
+Scope: scalar D27 proves only the marginals; delta x is a mean, and neither D27 nor H-AD-G is derived.
